#. 山田君…石丸君……
msgctxt "0001 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Hifumi...and Taka..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>一瞬だけ、霧切さんの表情が強張った気がした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>For a moment, Kyoko seemed to go rigid.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、それも一瞬だけで…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But *only* for a moment...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …始めましょうか。
msgctxt "0004 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Well then, let's get started."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女は、石丸クン死体の傍らに腰を落とすと、
#. なんの迷いもない手付きで死体に触れていく…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She crouched down next to Taka and without hesitation\n"
"began poking and prodding the bodies.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. モノクマファイルにあった通り…
#. ２人共、同じような凶器で殺されてるのね…
msgctxt "0006 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The Monokuma File was right. They were killed using\n"
"similar weapons."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その作業があまりに自然過ぎて…
#. あまりにも淡々とし過ぎて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Her movements were so smooth—she was so...calm.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もはや…ボクは違和感すら感じなくなっていた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Seeing how comfortable she was actually made *me* feel\n"
"a little more comfortable...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君、さっそく見つけたわよ…
msgctxt "0009 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Makoto. I found something."
msgstr ""

#. 見つけた…？
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You did...?"
msgstr ""

#. 石丸クンが左腕に<CLT 3>腕時計<CLT>をしていたのは
#. 知っているわよね？
msgctxt "0011 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"You remember the <CLT 3>wristwatch<CLT> Taka always wore on his\n"
"left hand?"
msgstr ""

#. そうだっけ…？
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "He did...?"
msgstr ""

#. 人間観察がおろそかなのね？
#. 人間が嫌いとか？
msgctxt "0013 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Are you so oblivious to the people around you? Do you\n"
"dislike other people that much?"
msgstr ""

#. いや、そういう訳じゃないけど…
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "N-No, that's not it..."
msgstr ""

#. …それで、その腕時計がどうしたの？
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Anyway, so you said he had a watch?"
msgstr ""

#. 見てみなさい…
msgctxt "0016 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Take a look..."
msgstr ""

#. 壊れているのよ。
#. 時計の針が動かなくなっているでしょ？
msgctxt "0017 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It's broken. You can see the hands aren't moving,\n"
"right?"
msgstr ""

#. おそらく、“誰か”と争った際に、
#. 壊れたんじゃないかしら…
msgctxt "0018 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It most likely broke when he had his encounter with\n"
"his assailant."
msgstr ""

#. しかも、針が<CLT 3>６時過ぎ<CLT>を指したところで
#. 止まってしまっているわ…
msgctxt "0019 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"And if you notice, the hands are frozen at <CLT 3>just past\n"
"6 o'clock<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、その時計は…
#. <CLT 3>６時過ぎ<CLT>に壊れたって事…？
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So that would mean...the watch was broken <CLT 3>sometime\n"
"just after 6<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. ただ、昨日の夜の時点では、
#. 石丸君の腕時計は壊れてなかったはずよ…
msgctxt "0021 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But last night, Taka's watch definitely wasn't\n"
"broken..."
msgstr ""

#. オイ、コラァ！　いつまで待たせんだッ！！
msgctxt "0022 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Hey! You! How long were you gonna keep us waiting!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>石丸クンは腕時計を確認しながら、
#. イラついたような声を張り上げていた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Taka's irritated voice pierced the air as he stared\n"
"pointedly at his wristwatch.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. もうすぐ１０時になっちまうぞ！
#. よい子は寝る時間だろうーがッ！！
msgctxt "0024 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"It's almost 10 o'clock, you know that!? Bedtime for\n"
"all the little boys and girls!"
msgstr ""

#. 昨日の夜の時点で壊れてなかったって事は、
#. この時計が壊れたのは、昨日の夕方６時じゃなくて…
msgctxt "0025 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"So if it worked at 10 last night, it couldn't have\n"
"been broken at 6 p.m."
msgstr ""

#. …<CLT 3>今朝の６時<CLT>って事になるね。
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Meaning it must have happened at <CLT 3>6 this morning<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>壊れた腕時計<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Broken Wristwatch<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 気になったのは、それだけじゃないわ。
#. 石丸君の左手を見て…
msgctxt "0028 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "And that's not all. Look at Taka's left hand."
msgstr ""

#. 何か握っているみたいなの…
msgctxt "0029 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "He appears to be gripping something..."
msgstr ""

#. ホントだ！　何か白い物が見えてる…
#. これって、なんだろう…？
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You're right! There's something...white in there."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君、取ってみて。
msgctxt "0031 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Can you try and pry it out?"
msgstr ""

#. …ボクが！？
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Me!?"
msgstr ""

#. 死体は死後硬直が始まってるわ…
#. こういう力仕事は男子の役割でしょ？
msgctxt "0033 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Rigor mortis has already set in. Boys are better\n"
"suited to this kind of manual labor, right?"
msgstr ""

#. わ、わかったよ…
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Okay..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクはしぶしぶ…石丸クンの冷え切った手を取った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As much as I didn't want to, I grasped Taka's cold\n"
"hand...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その氷のような冷たさに、
#. 思わず心臓が止まりそうになる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The ice-cold hand was nearly enough to cause my heart\n"
"to stop beating...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、固く握られた彼の手の中から、
#. やっとの思いで<CLT><CLT 3>“それ”<CLT><CLT 4>を取り出した。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After some effort, I was finally able to free the\n"
"<CLT><CLT 3>object<CLT><CLT 4> from his tightly clenched fist.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 紙の…切れ端…？
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "A...piece of paper?"
msgstr ""

#. 手にしていたのは…それだけ？
msgctxt "0039 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Was that all he had in his hand?"
msgstr ""

#. うん、これだけだったよ…
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah, that's it..."
msgstr ""

#. こんな切れ端だけじゃ…
#. 手掛かりにはならなそうだね？
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Just a little scrap of paper. Doesn't seem like much\n"
"of a clue, does it?"
msgstr ""

#. それはどうかしら…？
msgctxt "0042 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I wonder about that..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう言いながら霧切さんは、
#. 今度は山田クンの死体に向き直った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko then turned to Hifumi's body.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 次は、山田クンの死体を調べてみましょう。
#. 別の手掛かりが残されているかもしれないわ。
msgctxt "0044 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Let's check Hifumi's body now. Perhaps he's left us a\n"
"few clues of his own."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>石丸の持っていた紙の切れ端<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Kiyotaka's Scrap of Paper<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the\n"
"Truth Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …どう？　何かわかりそう？
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So? Did you find anything?"
msgstr ""

#. えぇ…思った以上の成果があったみたいよ。
msgctxt "0047 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I did. More than I expected, to be honest."
msgstr ""

#. これを見て…
msgctxt "0048 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Look at this..."
msgstr ""

#. 丸められた…紙？
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "A...wad of paper?"
msgstr ""

#. 山田君が隠し持っていたわ…
msgctxt "0050 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Hifumi had it hidden on him."
msgstr ""

#. 隠し持ってた…？
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hidden...?"
msgstr ""

#. パンツの中に入ってたのよ？
#. 隠したとしか考えられないでしょ？
msgctxt "0052 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"He'd stuffed it in his pants. So I can only assume\n"
"he'd hidden it on purpose, you see?"
msgstr ""

#. パンツの中って…まさか手を！？
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "In his pants...? Wait, so you—!?"
msgstr ""

#. たかがパンツよ。
#. 靴下に手を入れた訳じゃないわ…
msgctxt "0054 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It was just his pants. Not like his socks or\n"
"something..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その基準が…わからない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't...know what that means...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それより、その紙の確認を急ぎましょう。
#. 苗木君、紙を広げてみて…
msgctxt "0056 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Anyway, let's take a look at the paper. Go ahead,\n"
"Makoto. Open it up."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>山田クンのパンツの中に入ってたと思うと…
#. なんだか……なんて言うか……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When I think of how it was stuffed down his pants,\n"
"it's like...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これでどうしようもない物だったら、
#. 山田クンを許せなくなるかも…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...it better be important, Hifumi, or I'll never\n"
"forgive you for this!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …メモ書き！？
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...A note!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>『抜け道らしき穴を見つけた。
#. 　外が見える。ここから出られるかも…』
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0060 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"I found a hole maybe we can use to escape.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>『モノクマに勘付かれるとマズイから、
#. 　みんなに内緒で早朝６時に物理準備室に集合』
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0061 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"Monokuma can't find out, so don't tell anyone else\n"
"for now. Let's meet in the equipment room at 6 a.m.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. どこかで聞いた事があるような内容ね…
msgctxt "0062 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That sounds...very familiar."
msgstr ""

#. そうだ！　葉隠クンが言ってたのと同じだ！
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That's it! It's the same thing Hiro said!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、葉隠クンが言ってたのは、
#. 本当だったんだね！
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Then he was telling us the truth!"
msgstr ""

#. だけど、まったく同じって訳でもないわ…
msgctxt "0065 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Although...it's not exactly the same, is it?"
msgstr ""

#. 昨日の夜、俺の部屋のドアに、
#. <CLT 3>変なメモ<CLT>が挟まってたんだけど…
msgctxt "0066 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Last night, someone slipped a <CLT 3>weird note<CLT> under my\n"
"door."
msgstr ""

#. そこには、こう書いてあったんだ。
msgctxt "0067 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "And here's what it said..."
msgstr ""

#. 抜け道らしき穴を見つけた。
#. 外が見える。ここから出られるかも。
msgctxt "0068 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "\"I found a hole maybe we can use to escape.\""
msgstr ""

#. モノクマに勘付かれるとマズイから、
#. みんなに内緒で<CLT 3>深夜１時に娯楽室に集合<CLT>…って。
msgctxt "0069 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"\"Monokuma can't find out, so don't tell anyone else\n"
"for now. Let's meet in the <CLT 3>rec room at 1 a.m.<CLT>\""
msgstr ""

#. 時間帯が…違う…
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The time is different..."
msgstr ""

#. 葉隠クンの話だと、
#. 彼は<CLT 3>“深夜１時”<CLT>に呼び出されていたけど…
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hiro told us that his note said to meet at <CLT 3>1 a.m.<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 山田クンが受け取った、このメモでは、
#. <CLT 3>“朝６時”<CLT>に呼び出している。
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But the note they wrote to Hifumi asked him to meet at\n"
"<CLT 3>6 a.m.<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 待って。山田クンが持っていたからって、
#. 山田クンの物だとは限らないわよ。
msgctxt "0073 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Hold on. Just because Hifumi had the note, doesn't\n"
"mean it was meant for him."
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. そのメモ…右端の部分がちぎられてるでしょ？
#. そこに重要な意味があるはずよ。
msgctxt "0075 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Part of it has been torn off, right? I think there's\n"
"likely some meaning there."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このメモのちぎられた部分に…重要な意味が？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's some meaning to part of it being ripped...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あのさ、霧切さん…
#. もう少しだけ詳しく教えてくれない？
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Umm...could you maybe explain it a little more?"
msgstr ""

#. よく考えてみて…
msgctxt "0078 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Think carefully..."
msgstr ""

#. そもそも、彼はどうして
#. あんな紙の切れ端を大事に握っていたのかしらね？
msgctxt "0079 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Why would he have been clutching that scrap of paper\n"
"so tightly?"
msgstr ""

#. それは…わからないけど…
msgctxt "0080 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I...I have no idea..."
msgstr ""

#. 彼が握った時は、紙の切れ端じゃなくて、
#. もっと重要な物だったとしたら、どう？
msgctxt "0081 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"What if it *wasn't* just a scrap of paper when he was\n"
"holding it? What if it was something more important?"
msgstr ""

#. どうすれば、その重要な物が紙の切れ端になるのか…
#. そこに答えが隠されているわ。
msgctxt "0082 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"And how would something important like that become a\n"
"mere scrap of paper? That's what you need to answer."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>山田の持っていたメモ<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0083 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>The Note Hifumi Had<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それと、ついでに言っておくけど…
msgctxt "0084 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"And while we're at it, I should tell you one other\n"
"thing."
msgstr ""

#. 殺された２人は、今回はちゃんと
#. 自分の電子生徒手帳を持っていたわ。
msgctxt "0085 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The two victims this time definitely had their\n"
"e-Handbooks on them."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、この殺人のトリックには、
#. 電子生徒手帳は関係していないでしょうね。
msgctxt "0086 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"So the handbooks have nothing to do with how the\n"
"murders were carried out."
msgstr ""

#. まぁ、そもそも関係する余地なんて
#. なさそうだけど…
msgctxt "0087 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Not that there was any reason to think they were\n"
"connected to the killings in the first place..."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、今回は電子生徒手帳については、
#. 考えなくていいって事だね？
msgctxt "0088 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So you're saying I don't have to think about the\n"
"handbooks this time, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 考えなくていいなら、
#. わざわざ言ったりしないわ。
msgctxt "0089 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If you didn't have to think about them at all, I\n"
"wouldn't have gone out of my way to mention it."
msgstr ""

#. 私は、この殺人のトリックには関係してないって、
#. 言っただけよ…
msgctxt "0090 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"All I said was that they weren't used to help carry\n"
"out the murders."
msgstr ""

#. もしかしたら、必要になる時が来るかもしれない…
msgctxt "0091 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"There may come a point, however, where a handbook may\n"
"play a role."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>電子生徒手帳が必要になる時…？
#. 意味が…わからないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0092 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A handbook may play a role...? I...don't think I\n"
"understand.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…でも、霧切さんの言う事だし、
#. 一応、気には留めておくか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0093 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But if Kyoko thinks it's important, I'd better keep it\n"
"in mind...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>電子生徒手帳<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0094 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>e-Handbook<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth Bullets\n"
"section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「キーン、コーン…　カーン、コーン」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0095 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Ding dong, bing bong*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 楽しいなっ、楽しいなっ！
#. 学級裁判が始まるぞっ！！
msgctxt "0096 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Are you excited? Are you pumped!? It's time for the\n"
"class trial to begin!"
msgstr ""

#. 学級裁判…それは花火のような一瞬のキラメキ…
#. 生と死のぶつかり合いが生む、魂の閃光…
msgctxt "0097 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Like the bright burst of fireworks, like the flash of\n"
"a soul clashing with life and death...!"
msgstr ""

#. …という訳でッ！！
msgctxt "0098 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "And so, with no further ado...!"
msgstr ""

#. そんじゃあ、オマエラは、
#. いつもの場所に集合をお願いしまーす！
msgctxt "0099 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Everyone please meet at the usual spot!"
msgstr ""

#. ユー、学校エリア１階にある
#. 赤い扉にインしちゃいなよ！
msgctxt "0100 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Make your way to the red door on the first floor of\n"
"the school!"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ、じゃあ後でね～！！
msgctxt "0101 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Puhuhu. See you soon!"
msgstr ""

#. …残念だけど、捜査はここまでのようね。
msgctxt "0102 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It's unfortunate, but I suppose this is where our\n"
"investigation comes to an end."
msgstr ""

#. 後は、自分自身で考え…
#. そして、自分自身で結論を付けるしかないわ…
msgctxt "0103 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"You'll have to figure out the rest for yourself, and\n"
"come to the proper conclusion."
msgstr ""

#. うん…そうだね…
msgctxt "0104 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah...you're right..."
msgstr ""

#. それじゃあ、行きましょうか…
msgctxt "0105 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Well, we'd better get going."
msgstr ""

#. う、うん……
msgctxt "0106 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Okay..."
msgstr ""

#. 霧切ちゃん…
#. ああやって調べるの…怖くないのかな…？
msgctxt "0107 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Doesn't Kyoko get creeped out poking at dead bodies\n"
"and stuff...?"
msgstr ""

#. 今回の事件では、色んな事があった。
#. いや、色んな事があり過ぎた…と言うべきか。
msgctxt "0108 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"There are many aspects to the incident this time.\n"
"*Too* many, to be honest..."
msgstr ""

#. …思い出すという意味でも、
#. 事件を振り返ってみるのもいいかもしれんぞ。
msgctxt "0109 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Considering that, it may be good to look back on\n"
"everything that's happened."
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0110 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Good idea"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0111 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No thanks"
msgstr ""

#. 我が、その手伝いをしてやろうか…？
msgctxt "0112 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Would you like my help?"
msgstr ""

#. …そうだね、じゃあ一緒に振り返ってみようか。
msgctxt "0113 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah, let's look back on things."
msgstr ""

#. 今朝、食堂に集まったのは、
#. <CLT 3>我<CLT>と<CLT 3>苗木<CLT>と<CLT 3>朝日奈<CLT>と<CLT 3>霧切<CLT>の４人だけだったな。
msgctxt "0114 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"This morning, only four of us met up at the dining\n"
"hall—<CLT 3>Hina<CLT>, <CLT 3>Kyoko<CLT>, <CLT 3>you<CLT>, and <CLT 3>myself<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. いくら待っても他の者が来ないので、
#. 我らは、来ない連中の捜索を開始する事にしたんだ。
msgctxt "0115 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"We waited for the others, but nobody showed up. So we\n"
"decided to go look for them."
msgstr ""

#. その捜索を始めたのが、<CLT 3>８時頃<CLT>の事だったな…
msgctxt "0116 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "It was around <CLT 3>8 o'clock<CLT> when we began our search."
msgstr ""

#. そこで、手分けした直後から、
#. 霧切さんがいなくなったんだよね…
msgctxt "0117 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And soon after we split up, Kyoko disappeared..."
msgstr ""

#. その後、朝日奈が<CLT 3>３階の娯楽室<CLT>で<CLT 3>セレス<CLT>を見つけ、
#. 慌てて、苗木や我を集めたのだ。
msgctxt "0118 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"After that, Hina found <CLT 3>Celeste<CLT> in the <CLT 3>rec room, on\n"
"the 3rd floor<CLT>, then quickly came and got you and me."
msgstr ""

#. セレスさんの話によると、彼女は不審者に襲われてから
#. １時間ほど気を失っていたらしいよ。
msgctxt "0119 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"According to Celeste, she was attacked by a suspicious\n"
"individual and lay unconscious for about an hour."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、彼女が襲われたのは、
#. ボクらに発見される１時間くらい前…
msgctxt "0120 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"In other words, she was attacked an hour before we\n"
"found her."
msgstr ""

#. …<CLT 3>７時過ぎ<CLT>って事になるね。
msgctxt "0121 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Meaning, <CLT 3>just after 7 o'clock<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. その際、セレスが撮った画像により、
#. その不審者が妙なコスプレをしている事がわかった。
msgctxt "0122 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Based on the picture Celeste took, we discovered her\n"
"attacker was dressed in a strange costume."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>ジャスティスロボ<CLT>…だったな…
msgctxt "0123 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "It was...<CLT 3>Robo Justice<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. しかも、そのジャスティスロボに、
#. <CLT 3>山田が連れ去られている<CLT>という事実も判明したのだ。
msgctxt "0124 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It also became clear that this Robo Justice had\n"
"<CLT 3>dragged Hifumi away<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 不審者の捜索を始めた我らは、
#. 腐川や十神と合流した後…
msgctxt "0125 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"After meeting up with Toko and Byakuya, we began\n"
"searching for the costumed assailant."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>２階の図書室<CLT>で、<CLT 3>傷を負った山田<CLT>を発見した。
msgctxt "0126 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"We found an <CLT 3>injured Hifumi<CLT> in the <CLT 3>library, on the\n"
"2nd floor<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 我らは、傷付いた山田を<CLT 3>１階の保健室<CLT>に連れていき、
#. 再び不審者の捜索を再開したんだ。
msgctxt "0127 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"We took him down to the <CLT 3>nurse's office, on the 1st\n"
"floor<CLT>, then resumed our search."
msgstr ""

#. そして、保健室から出た直後…
msgctxt "0128 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "But not long after leaving the nurse's office..."
msgstr ""

#. …ッ！？
msgctxt "0129 | CELES"
msgid "...!?"
msgstr ""

#. …どうした？
msgctxt "0130 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "What's wrong...?"
msgstr ""

#. 影です…あの階段の上で影が動きました！
msgctxt "0131 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I saw a shadow! Something moving around at the top of\n"
"the stairs!"
msgstr ""

#. セレスさんの目撃証言を元に、ボクらは<CLT 3>２階<CLT>へ行き、
#. そこから手分けして捜索する事になった。
msgctxt "0132 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Based on Celeste's claims, we went back up to the <CLT 3>2nd\n"
"floor<CLT>, where we split up and began searching."
msgstr ""

#. そうしたら、その直後…
msgctxt "0133 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Then, right after that..."
msgstr ""

#. セレスが叫び声を上げた。
#. 今度は<CLT 3>３階<CLT>で不審者の姿を見つけたのだ。
msgctxt "0134 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Celeste screamed. This time she had apparently seen\n"
"the suspect on the <CLT 3>3rd floor<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. あいつの叫び声を聞き、
#. 我らもすぐに<CLT 3>３階<CLT>へと向かった。
msgctxt "0135 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Hearing her screams, we quickly made our way to the\n"
"<CLT 3>3rd floor<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. セレスちゃん、どうしたの！？
msgctxt "0136 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Celeste! What's wrong!?"
msgstr ""

#. お前にしては、やけに大げさな叫び声だったな…
msgctxt "0137 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"That was a rather...intense scream for someone like\n"
"you."
msgstr ""

#. 見つけたのです…例のコスプレ不審者を…
msgctxt "0138 | CELES"
msgid "I saw him! The strange costumed man...!"
msgstr ""

#. わたくしが叫び声を上げたら、
#. 逃げていきました。
msgctxt "0139 | CELES"
msgid "He ran off as soon as I screamed..."
msgstr ""

#. 階段を背にしたわたくしに対して、
#. 左側の廊下の奥を曲がっていきましたわ。
msgctxt "0140 | CELES"
msgid ""
"I was blocking the stairs, so he headed further down\n"
"into the hallway and disappeared...!"
msgstr ""

#. そして、その直後…
#. 今度は…
msgctxt "0141 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "And then..."
msgstr ""

#. ギニャアアアアアアアーッ！！
msgctxt "0142 | NO NAME"
msgid "Ungyaaaaaahhh!!!"
msgstr ""

#. …えっ！？
msgctxt "0143 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh!?"
msgstr ""

#. な、何ッ…！？
msgctxt "0144 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Wh-What was that!?"
msgstr ""

#. 下の階から聞えましたわね。
#. という事は、今の悲鳴は…！
msgctxt "0145 | CELES"
msgid "That came from downstairs! It must have been..."
msgstr ""

#. 保健室にいる…山田クンの…？
msgctxt "0146 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hifumi! He's in the nurse's office!"
msgstr ""

#. マズイよ！　急いで戻ろう！！
msgctxt "0147 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "This is bad! Come on, we have to go back!"
msgstr ""

#. そこで、ボクらは二手に分かれる事になったんだ。
msgctxt "0148 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "At that point, we decided to split up into two groups."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>ボク<CLT>と<CLT 3>セレスさん<CLT>と<CLT 3>朝日奈さん<CLT>は、
#. １階の保健室に戻り…
msgctxt "0149 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 3>Celeste<CLT>, <CLT 3>Hina<CLT>, and <CLT 3>I<CLT> went back to the nurse's\n"
"office."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>大神さん<CLT>と<CLT 3>十神クン<CLT>と<CLT 3>腐川さん<CLT>が、
#. ３階で不審者を追ったんだ。
msgctxt "0150 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Meanwhile, <CLT 3>you<CLT>, <CLT 3>Byakuya<CLT>, and <CLT 3>Toko<CLT> pursued the\n"
"suspect up on the 3rd floor."
msgstr ""

#. そして、ボクは戻った保健室で…
msgctxt "0151 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And when we got back to the nurse's office..."
msgstr ""

#. 山田クンの死体を発見したんだ。
msgctxt "0152 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...we found Hifumi's corpse."
msgstr ""

#. ボクはそこで…
#. <CLT 3>死体発見アナウンス<CLT>が流れるのを聞いたんだよ。
msgctxt "0153 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Which is also when we heard the <CLT 3>body discovery\n"
"announcement<CLT> play."
msgstr ""

#. その事を伝える為、セレスさんと朝日奈さんを残して、
#. ボクは再び３階へと戻った。
msgctxt "0154 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I left Celeste and Hina alone and headed back to the\n"
"3rd floor to tell the others what had happened."
msgstr ""

#. だが、その時…我らは<CLT 3>３階の物理準備室<CLT>で、
#. 石丸の死体を発見したところだった。
msgctxt "0155 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"But at that same time, we had discovered Taka's body\n"
"in the <CLT 3>equipment room<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 山田と石丸の死体が発見されたのは、
#. <CLT 3>ほぼ同時<CLT>だったはずだ…
msgctxt "0156 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Which means Hifumi and Taka's bodies were discovered\n"
"<CLT 3>right around the same time<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 我も、石丸の死体を発見した直後、
#. あのアナウンスが流れるのを聞いたからな。
msgctxt "0157 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Because I remember hearing the body discovery\n"
"announcement play right after finding Taka."
msgstr ""

#. そこで、ボクは大神さんと十神クンに、
#. 山田クンが殺されていた事を伝えたんだよね？
msgctxt "0158 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And that's when I showed up and told you and Byakuya\n"
"that Hifumi had been killed, right?"
msgstr ""

#. それで、<CLT 3>ボク<CLT>と<CLT 3>大神さん<CLT>と<CLT 3>十神クン<CLT>は、
#. 一緒に保健室に向かう事になったんだ。
msgctxt "0159 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Then <CLT 3>you<CLT>, <CLT 3>me<CLT>, and <CLT 3>Byakuya<CLT> all headed back to the\n"
"nurse's office..."
msgstr ""

#. 気絶した腐川さんを置いてね…
msgctxt "0160 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...leaving behind Toko, who had fainted."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、物理室から出た直後…
msgctxt "0161 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But as soon as we left the physics lab..."
msgstr ""

#. 遅れてやって来たセレスさんから、
#. ボクらは驚くべき話を聞く事になったんだ。
msgctxt "0162 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"...we ran into Celeste, who'd just arrived to tell us\n"
"something very unusual."
msgstr ""

#. 山田君の死体が消えてしまったのです！
msgctxt "0163 | CELES"
msgid "Hifumi's body has disappeared!"
msgstr ""

#. 急いで戻った保健室には、
#. もう山田クンの死体はなかった…
msgctxt "0164 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"We hurried back to the nurse's office, to discover\n"
"that his corpse was, in fact, gone."
msgstr ""

#. その直後、気絶した腐川を置いてきた事を思い出し、
#. 我らは再び<CLT 3>物理準備室<CLT>へと戻ったのだが…
msgctxt "0165 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Then we remembered we had abandoned the unconscious\n"
"Toko, and rushed back to the <CLT 3>equipment room<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. まさか…これは…？
msgctxt "0166 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "This can't be happening..."
msgstr ""

#. 我らは…夢でも見ているのか？
msgctxt "0167 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Are we hallucinating all this or something?"
msgstr ""

#. 今度は、石丸クンの死体も消えてしまったんだ…
msgctxt "0168 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "This time, Taka's body had disappeared."
msgstr ""

#. ボクらは慌てて、
#. 消えた２人の死体の捜索に取り掛かった。
msgctxt "0169 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So from there, we began our search for both of the\n"
"missing bodies."
msgstr ""

#. そして、しばらくすると…
msgctxt "0170 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And after some time..."
msgstr ""

#. セレスが死体を見つけたと聞き、
#. 我らは<CLT 3>美術倉庫<CLT>へと向かったのだったな…
msgctxt "0171 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Celeste told us she'd found the bodies, and we all\n"
"headed to the <CLT 3>repository<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. そこで、消えていた２人の死体を
#. “再発見”したんだ…
msgctxt "0172 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And there we rediscovered the two bodies that had\n"
"apparently vanished."
msgstr ""

#. …こんな流れだったよね。
msgctxt "0173 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...And that brings us up to now."
msgstr ""

#. こうやって振り返ってみると、
#. 本当に色々な事が起きたものだ…
msgctxt "0174 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Looking back, things have certainly been very\n"
"active..."
msgstr ""

#. また事件を振り返りたくなったら我に言え。
#. いつでも協力してやるぞ…
msgctxt "0175 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If you want to look back at the case again, just let\n"
"me know. I'm fine anytime."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんなモニターを気にしてても仕方がない。
#. 放っておこう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0176 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no point thinking about the monitor. Best to\n"
"just forget about it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな監視カメラを気にしてても仕方がない。
#. 放っておこう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0177 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no point thinking about the surveillance\n"
"camera. Best to just forget about it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>石丸クンの致命傷は、頭部の殴打だったはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0178 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Taka was killed by a blow to the head.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>物理準備室に落ちていたジャスティスハンマー４号で
#. やられたんだろうな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0179 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He must have been struck with Justice Hammer 4, which\n"
"was laying on the floor in the equipment room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それと、石丸クンの死体の下に、
#. ビニールシートが敷かれているけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0180 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And there's a tarp laid out under his body...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって、石丸クンの死体を運ぶ際に、
#. 犯人が使った物なのかも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0181 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The killer must have used it to move Taka's body.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>運ぶ際に血の跡を残さないように…って。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0182 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That way it wouldn't leave any bloodstains as it was\n"
"moved...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>取っ手がないタイプの台車だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0183 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a dolly. It doesn't have a handle...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>美術室とかで見るような台車だ。
#. 彫像とかを乗せておくのに使われてたり…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0184 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm sure I saw it in the art room. It's used to move\n"
"sculptures and stuff around...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>使い勝手は悪いけど、腰を曲げて姿勢を低くすれば、
#. 転がす事自体は問題なさそうだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0185 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's kinda awkward, but if you bend down, it's not too\n"
"hard to use.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それより、この台車…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0186 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But more importantly...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>物理準備室<CLT><CLT 4>で石丸クンの死体を見つけた時にあった、
#. あの台車じゃないのか？<CLT>
msgctxt "0187 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Wasn't this in the <CLT><CLT 3>equipment room<CLT><CLT 4> when we found\n"
"Taka's body?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それに、この台車のタイヤ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0188 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And look at the wheel...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>血痕が付着している。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0189 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a bloodstain on it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>物理準備室<CLT><CLT 4>から<CLT><CLT 3>美術倉庫<CLT><CLT 4>に移動した台車…
#. そのタイヤに付着した<CLT><CLT 3>血痕<CLT><CLT 4>…<CLT>
msgctxt "0190 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So there's <CLT><CLT 3>blood<CLT><CLT 4> on the wheel of the dolly that was\n"
"moved from the <CLT><CLT 3>equipment room<CLT><CLT 4> to the <CLT><CLT 3>repository<CLT><CLT 4>...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これらが意味する事って…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0191 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What's the explanation for that...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>山田クンの死体で気になっている点は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0192 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The biggest problem I have right now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>犯人は、この大きな山田クンを
#. どうやって運んだのかって事だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0193 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...is how the killer was able to move Hifumi's massive\n"
"corpse.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だって、最初に死体が発見された<CLT><CLT 3>保健室は１階<CLT><CLT 4>で、
#. この<CLT><CLT 3>美術倉庫は３階<CLT><CLT 4>なんだぞ…<CLT>
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0194 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>From <CLT><CLT 3>the nurse's office<CLT><CLT 4> where he was discovered to\n"
"here, the <CLT><CLT 3>repository<CLT><CLT 4>…<CLT>\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この巨体を１階から３階まで、
#. しかも、ボクらの目に付かないように運ぶなんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0195 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>All the way from the 1st floor to the 3rd... And all\n"
"without anyone noticing it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そんな方法なんて…思い付かない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0196 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I just can't see how that's possible.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それと、山田クンの致命傷は
#. 頭部の殴打だったみたいだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0197 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Further, it seems that Hifumi died from a blow to the\n"
"head.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>きっと、保健室にあったジャスティスハンマー３号で
#. やられたんだろう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0198 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He was most likely killed using Justice Hammer 3,\n"
"which we found in the nurse's office...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0199 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>保健室で見つけた時、
#. 死体のメガネは血で汚れていたはずなのに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0200 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When we found his body in the nurse's office, his\n"
"glasses were covered in blood.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…今はキレイになっている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0201 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But now they're spotless...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>誰かが山田クンのメガネを拭いたって事か？
#. だとしたら、誰がなんの為に…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0202 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Does that mean someone wiped his glasses clean? But\n"
"who would do that? And why...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>壁には大小様々なハンマーが掛けられている。
#. けど…いくつか歯抜けになってるな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0203 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are hammers of all different sizes hanging on\n"
"the wall. Although some are more like mallets...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もしかして、このハンマーを元にして、
#. ジャスティスハンマーが作られたのかも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0204 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Could the Justice Hammers have been designed...using\n"
"these as a model?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それにしても、ここのハンマーは、
#. どれも、かなり使い込まれているみたいだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0205 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Either way, all the hammers here have obviously seen a\n"
"lot of use.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>石の破片や粉なんかが、
#. あちこちに付着している。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0206 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They're all covered in debris and chalky stone\n"
"powder...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. でも…
msgctxt "0207 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんか…このハンマーだけ水に濡れてて、
#. 汚れてないんだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0208 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>For some reason this one hammer isn't dirty at all.\n"
"And it's also wet.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>誰かがこのハンマーを
#. <CLT><CLT 3>水で洗った<CLT><CLT 4>って事か？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0209 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Did someone <CLT><CLT 3>wash<CLT><CLT 4> it recently...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんの捜査結果が気になるな…
#. 彼女から話を聞いてみよう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0210 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm interested to hear about Kyoko's investigation\n"
"results. I should go talk to her...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんの捜査結果が気になるな…
#. 彼女から話を聞いてみよう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0211 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm interested to hear about Kyoko's investigation\n"
"results. I should go talk to her...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
